    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a ruler and set forth on a multi-year campaign to conquer the Bannerlands in this modern re-imagining of the critically acclaimed  Age of Rivals.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/23baabb72b6b346f304fe81c5855f310.poster.avif?t=1752243358\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/23baabb72b6b346f304fe81c5855f310.webm?t=1752243358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/23baabb72b6b346f304fe81c5855f310.mp4?t=1752243358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Card Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft strategic combinations of cards to outwit your opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your city\u2019s attack, defense, culture, and economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize powerful card abilities to turn the tide in your favor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/6eaf7fd460daf73150e7ad820426a59e.poster.avif?t=1752243358\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/6eaf7fd460daf73150e7ad820426a59e.webm?t=1752243358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/6eaf7fd460daf73150e7ad820426a59e.mp4?t=1752243358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedurally Generated Campaigns</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven diplomacy where choices matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests that adapt to the shifting attitudes between rulers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research unique technologies to improve your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful passive abilities to create unstoppable combos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/b9d42345f17e6ea88581dcf309d33474.poster.avif?t=1752243358\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/b9d42345f17e6ea88581dcf309d33474.webm?t=1752243358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495400/extras/b9d42345f17e6ea88581dcf309d33474.mp4?t=1752243358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every campaign has unique rulers, cards, stories, quests, locations, and technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn battle mechanics with difficult to master strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine unique playable rulers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of cards with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging AI opponents</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
